category: Editors
requires: 
sdesc: "Gedit Technology - Actions, Menus and Toolbars Kit (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "It is a library based on GTK. Amtk is the acronym for 'Actions, Menus and
Toolbars Kit'. It is a basic GtkUIManager replacement based on GAction. It is
suitable for both a traditional UI or a modern UI with a GtkHeaderBar."

